---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
---

<Layout
  title="M221Tech | Useful products from local data"
  description="M221Tech builds simple, useful products from local data across sports and nutrition, and shares selected datasets."
>
  <section class="m221-hero m221-home-hero">
    <div class="m221-container m221-home-hero-inner">
      <span class="m221-kicker">Local data, made useful.</span>
      <h1>We build useful products from local data.</h1>
      <p class="m221-home-hero-copy">Sports, nutrition, culture — and a few ideas in between. We collect, structure and shape overlooked data into things people can actually use.</p>
      <div class="m221-actions">
        <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-primary" href="#products">See what we're building</a>
        <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-secondary" href="#contact">Say hello</a>
      </div>
      <div class="m221-home-hero-foot" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Sports</span><span>Nutrition</span><span>Open data</span><span>From the lab</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section m221-build" id="products">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head m221-build-head">
        <h2>What we build</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">Two areas for now. We go deep, keep things useful, and let the products speak.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="m221-vertical-grid">
        <a class="m221-vertical m221-vertical-sports" href="/sports/">
          <div class="m221-vertical-top">
            <span class="m221-pill">Sports</span>
            <span class="m221-vertical-index">01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="m221-vertical-body">
            <h3>Closer to the game.</h3>
            <p class="m221-project-signature">M221Foot <span>·</span> WC2026</p>
            <p class="m221-vertical-copy">Football data with more context, more detail and less noise.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="m221-vertical-link">Explore Sports <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>

        <a class="m221-vertical m221-vertical-nutrition" href="/nutrition/">
          <div class="m221-vertical-top">
            <span class="m221-pill">Nutrition</span>
            <span class="m221-vertical-index">02</span>
          </div>
          <div class="m221-vertical-body">
            <h3>What really ends up on the plate.</h3>
            <p class="m221-project-signature">Lekkantu</p>
            <p class="m221-vertical-copy">Nutrition data grounded in the products people actually buy and eat.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="m221-vertical-link">Explore Nutrition <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section">
    <div class="m221-container m221-statement">
      <span class="m221-kicker">Why M221Tech</span>
      <h2>Local data deserves better products.</h2>
      <p>Useful information is often scattered, incomplete or hard to find. We do the patient work behind the scenes, then keep the result simple.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section" id="open">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head">
        <h2>Some things are better shared.</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">We keep our methods in-house, but selected datasets are open and reports can be requested.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="m221-grid-2">
        <article class="m221-card">
          <span class="m221-pill">Open Data</span>
          <h3>Datasets you can explore and reuse</h3>
          <p>Selected public releases across sports, nutrition and other local-data themes, including publications on Kaggle.</p>
          <a class="m221-card-link" href="/open/#data">Browse the datasets →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="m221-card">
          <span class="m221-pill">Reports</span>
          <h3>Focused reports, on request</h3>
          <p>Have a question worth digging into? We can prepare a focused analysis from the data we cover.</p>
          <a class="m221-card-link" href="mailto:m221tech@gmail.com?subject=M221Tech%20report%20request">Request a report →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head">
        <h2>A small studio, already in motion.</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">A simple snapshot for now. We will add deeper product metrics only when they are useful and verified.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="m221-metrics">
        <div class="m221-metric"><strong>3</strong><span>active products</span></div>
        <div class="m221-metric"><strong>2</strong><span>product verticals</span></div>
        <div class="m221-metric"><strong>1</strong><span>lab project</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-section" id="lab">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <div class="m221-section-head">
        <h2>From the lab</h2>
        <p class="m221-section-intro">Side ideas, experiments and questions worth exploring.</p>
      </div>

      <article class="m221-lab">
        <span class="m221-pill">Culture & local knowledge</span>
        <h3>Kurel Facts</h3>
        <p>A small data experiment around cultural observations, structure and visual exploration.</p>
        <a href="https://kurel.m221.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore Kurel Facts →</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="m221-contact" id="contact">
    <div class="m221-container">
      <span class="m221-kicker">Contact</span>
      <h2>Got something in mind?</h2>
      <p>A dataset, a report, a collaboration, or simply an idea worth discussing — say hello.</p>
      <div class="m221-actions">
        <a class="m221-btn m221-btn-primary" href="mailto:m221tech@gmail.com">Say hello</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
